# EV Charging Finder

An interactive EV charging station finder with dynamic scraping support and real-time map visualization.

## Features

- Search EV stations by state and district
- Interactive OpenStreetMap integration
- Flask backend APIs
- Responsive modern UI
- Selenium-based scraping support
- CSV-based station management

## Tech Stack

- Python
- Flask
- Selenium
- JavaScript
- HTML/CSS
- Leaflet.js
- Pandas

## Project Structure

```text
backend/
frontend/
scraping/
data/
```

## Installation

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## Run Project

```bash
python main.py
```

Open:

```text
http://127.0.0.1:5000
```

## Scraping

The project includes Selenium-based scraping utilities for collecting EV charging station data from supported sources.

